# Active variation is V2

V2 is finalized as the product we change. Treat `/` (Citeo cream, Newsreader, lavender) as the site.

- Edit `app/page.tsx`, `components/home/`, `config/brand.ts`, `content/*.ts`, and shared check/blog code.
- Visual source of truth is `design/Sample Dashboard.png`.
- Git: stay on `citeo-preview`. Commit and push to remote `citeo-v2` (`PRD---ai-checker2`).
- Do not edit `app/v3/**`, `components/v3/**`, `config/v3.ts`, `content/v3.ts`, or `app/v3.css` unless the user names V3.
- Do not push to `origin` (V1 production) or `citeo-v3` unless the user asks.
